<title>POLAND: Polish 1996 dwellings output falls 18.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Polish 1996 dwellings output falls 18.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of dwellings completed in 1996 fell 18.2 percent against 1995 even though it jumped 128.7 percent in December against November, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said 11,776 dwellings were completed in December bringing the total for the January-December period to 54,855 dwellings.</p>
<p> POLISH DWELLINGS OUTPUT	1996	 1995</p>
<p> pct change vs pvs year	-18.2	 -11.8</p>
<p> number of flats built	  54,855     67,060</p>
